{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tinker Shot is a turned based spell building roguelike. You explore a world and tackle enemies by launching crafted spells at them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351280/extras/tinker_shot_battle_2.gif?t=1739883256\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is filled with a lot of emergent gameplay and forces players to fight in multiple unique ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351280/extras/tinker_shot_battle.gif?t=1739883256\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are able to create a diverse amount of whacky and broken spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351280/extras/steam_gif.gif?t=1739883256\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3351280?t=1739883256","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351280/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1739883256","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351280/74d6229dc61a861a823abfced143a9ee07631200/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739883256","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351280/74d6229dc61a861a823abfced143a9ee07631200/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739883256","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3487470,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tinker Shot is a turned based spell building roguelike. You explore a world and tackle enemies by launching